<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f0ec">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background:#f2f0ec"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff"><tr><td style="padding:28px 24px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e1a16">

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e1a16">{{ if .ServerURL }}<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .ServerURL }}</span> has{{ else }}The server has{{ end }} stopped calling the identity provider's UserInfo endpoint: the last {{ .ConsecutiveFailures }} calls failed.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">Logins still work, with the ID token's claims alone. A claim only UserInfo sends, such as a groups claim, is missing from every login until the calls resume, so a role that depends on it does not count. One login every 15 minutes retries the call, and the calls resume by themselves once a retry succeeds. The admin diagnostics page shows the current state.</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
  <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Paused at</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ datetime .PausedAt }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Next retry after</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ datetime .NextProbeAt }}</td></tr>
</table>

{{ if .Advanced }}
<p style="margin:32px 0 4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5d5751">Details</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Endpoint</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .Endpoint }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Failures in a row</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .ConsecutiveFailures }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Last error</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ if .LastError }}{{ .LastError }}{{ else }}not recorded{{ end }}</td></tr>
</table>
{{ end }}

<p style="margin:32px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">
Sent to every admin. This message is always sent when the server pauses its UserInfo calls; it is not a notification preference and cannot be turned off.
</p>

</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
